### get-users

POST https://echo.kulala.app/post HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ request-chaining-token }}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Alice",
      "age": 30
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "Bob",
      "age": 25
    }
  ]
}
